
=====================================================
                TEXT DECORATION — FULL NOTES
=====================================================

text-decoration controls decorative lines added to text.
It can underline, overline, strike-through text and can
also control the line's color, style, and thickness.

----------------------------------------------
1) text-decoration-line
----------------------------------------------
Controls WHICH line appears.

Values:
- underline        → line below the text
- overline         → line above the text
- line-through     → strike-through text
- none             → removes decoration

----------------------------------------------
2) text-decoration-color
----------------------------------------------
Changes the color of the decoration line.

Example:
  text-decoration-color: red;

----------------------------------------------
3) text-decoration-style
----------------------------------------------
Controls the style of the line.

Values:
- solid
- dotted
- dashed
- double
- wavy

Example:
  text-decoration-style: dotted;

----------------------------------------------
4) text-decoration-thickness
----------------------------------------------
Controls the thickness of the line.

Values:
- auto        → browser default
- <length>    → e.g., 2px, 3px
- from-font   → uses font's recommended weight

Example:
  text-decoration-thickness: 3px;

----------------------------------------------
5) Shorthand: text-decoration
----------------------------------------------
You can combine ALL properties in one line:

Format:
text-decoration: line style color thickness;

Example:
  text-decoration: underline dotted blue 2px;

Meaning:
- underline line
- dotted style
- blue color
- 2px thickness

----------------------------------------------
Why we use text-decoration:
----------------------------------------------
- To style or remove link underlines
- To create custom underline designs
- To show sale prices with line-through
- To emphasize or highlight text
- To improve visual design control

